Package: tg-expert
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Program for timing mechanical watches
 tg-expert is a program to evaluate the performance of mechanical
 watch movements. It works with the noise produced by a watch mechanism, and it
 produces real-time readings of the rate (or accuracy) and various other
 operational parameters. It also records long-term trends per watch position.
 .
 It is based on Tg by Marcello Mamino and contributors, and on tg-timer by
 Alejandro Grigera.
